<title>JAPAN: Japan Sept aluminium alloy output, shipments rise.</title>
<headline>Japan Sept aluminium alloy output, shipments rise.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's output and shipments of aluminium alloy rose in September from the same month a year ago, the Japan Aluminium Alloy Refiners Association said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Output rose 3.6 percent year-on-year to 78,352 tonnes and shipments were up 5.3 percent at 79,811 tonnes.</p>
<p>For the April-September half-year, aluminium alloy output was up 1.0 percent from the year-ago period at 454,498 tonnes and shipments were 1.4 percent higher at 459,874 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
